        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十月二十号，里昂站首轮，法国人穆泰对阵同胞安贝尔。打到决胜盘，穆泰二比零领先。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "fb664efef2c6e416810edbea9a5a3dd751ab2024e7563cf4673c625931c24c34",
      "words_sha256": "fe8d41679de9d0a4a088fbc1b00549fa97ba118b12abcfba77ba98f74f65ea25",
      "words_path": "voice_01.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c2216ebd0f8768b71301687de29031a4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "打完这一分，他突然倒在了地上。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "fc501493ac6080228c9857f646e256cc9701674e960742eddafb6ecece2a1948",
      "words_sha256": "45701afd00e52a87933e8391013e8bad77f3b2d49ec206e4ef522931391215ab",
      "words_path": "voice_04.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d4c84936d5ed2d29d9ddfef6b1cf5812",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "他被扶了起来，比赛接着打。可主裁还是判他超时，给了一次警告。按规则，抽筋不能叫医疗暂停。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "5e83c72c21eb14375b248b75f6c02cce018041752245ecc73566f3b9c9a1c3ac",
      "words_sha256": "469d94fde7984c1908c3679e9b4b5f46c96c52fb5ed72c2bed900c7ae7a54fc8",
      "words_path": "voice_05.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5bd4105fa6954af0a46e47d92c963b60",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决胜盘打进抢七，他先零比二落后。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "7b04c39e5989b77fa22d7d8ac8eff07e738dc75e4dbff7cdb3d7ab7b3824cd56",
      "words_sha256": "1f327f2e6ba98340c0b0999fe32fc72976734485a28674cd0adfcc2dc079dc13",
      "words_path": "voice_06.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bfb619d507ad8833bf964dfde578c00b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "接下来九分，他拿了七分，七比四赢下抢七。可抽筋倒地，为什么还会被警告？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "5f991a5a28fdb034eb895d3d810f40a207cb01541b17ddf5177008b56d79fc5b",
      "words_sha256": "741dde0c9c81d71b1d2894be1d055addb18bd0119b764d364a5ed0f6b04a5fc8",
      "words_path": "voice_08.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "004656d3eb632f047b1f1d44164fc217",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "先看规则。ATP和大满贯的规则都写着：抽筋，不能叫医疗暂停。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "a272e4f067954a8fffadc51d1ebf5ec8ac4d2195135cb5f9d5adfd3b2223bb4e",
      "words_sha256": "033190ae1215653cdea94a53704e226232d0af7a9d82bbedfce344aca109beca",
      "words_path": "voice_09.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b8df55097ec75c951f824cbade1c1903",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "只能在换边的九十秒，或者盘间的一百二十秒里治疗。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "bf588961b2226c32cb88bd9dd7c5dbe9b3ca8d19f79d48a67850787fb7886166",
      "words_sha256": "478f5d09b3e3abaf6accc38f106651bf78c70a0b44136da36fd88264dabbf4fe",
      "words_path": "voice_10.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7e45dead11eb4fe98a9a4fe1b5a2f998",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "一场比赛，抽筋最多治疗两次。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "e5966203045d17f4e0d44ec81b21485e4f12766eb11bdd56080211467878d70a",
      "words_sha256": "397ee04d4e786d6d0533d76a598481572ac38b0766df824294d21da6750e329e",
      "words_path": "voice_11.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "295b9eb154f01d0298d7d1231d316d6b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "分与分之间，只有二十五秒。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "f80b44f91e86defd93518d1726ff8465731a3c21c8ff5a31899a235c9822d93f",
      "words_sha256": "71ef9f22dc6d21d5a169ec8e35c53ac585167b003c0cbbddde7f1a3ac719b7e0",
      "words_path": "voice_12.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "59d8b688ec6b3b1d503d1d36c3b3a835",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第一次超时，是警告；再犯，发球方判一次发球失误，接发方直接丢一分。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "39028eb176421dad6790f1ad63948b0692a8257cb1e719ee3f2caf90d5789d88",
      "words_sha256": "320383497608ae3002b00a2cee0f550df907fc04d47043b79063d88c498bc0b5",
      "words_path": "voice_13.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5577ac6e48246ff68972404665de4970",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "真撑不住，可以先放弃几分、甚至几局，拖到换边再治。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c55fa650cfdb6fd529c8948c9ed65f397b6886e384b2479591bea5e80a877174",
      "words_sha256": "37d2ede2c5df6bd107c6039aeb129f16d0c84441785e3c752861cdc88c622ffc",
      "words_path": "voice_14.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "616f644cecb7163304a0dd11f8067cad",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这条规则，不少球员都碰上过。二零二一年迈阿密，梅德韦杰夫第三盘抽筋，一瘸一拐，最后七比六、六比七、六比四赢下波佩林。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "3e62cf290a57fded7a5cb115b85c84d0507dbe33325dfa10679aff91f5accd62",
      "words_sha256": "14e7503e076aabfab298f2a20f64ca643d480c6a839a87f52446c912d807503b",
      "words_path": "voice_16.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1f74f619ca20eaa2ba3959fc77133f51",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二二年阿卡普尔科，科兹洛夫对季米特洛夫。第二盘，他打着打着就抽筋了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "07fca44533e66cbf3a0da3d7a6bd6baeb2cda817ff8aa39583484ade33f18c4b",
      "words_sha256": "002297c3a94792ae8286d4997d3b928f5760018eae4c60951d5944c341cfd854",
      "words_path": "voice_19.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f1763aae8465440debd724defbc75b8f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "最后科兹洛夫赢了，打了三小时二十一分钟。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "41e0c4ec7f0bf0e0c754aa08c0be798a675c3fae0f54eead8e8226a735d30d7e",
      "words_sha256": "8d1a6979ec5c5e682b040d48f5ebf46d233134eb26ea366dc2034e389bf105d5",
      "words_path": "voice_20.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "2f9d77ba12495c602bb2e99b1eec40ec",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二五年上海，天气又湿又热，辛纳右腿抽筋。第三盘二比三落后，他选择退赛，和格里克斯普尔握手。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "88799cb9283ef16c469729d606860a8a49dec5c22ae4a2d16cbd28d9c28ffda1",
      "words_sha256": "7b823b369e6ae83613dfa4d2d76839dfe54d39d43c5fd8ace7ec049527d6aee9",
      "words_path": "voice_21.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ac3d75aa09f0e7a2dd713324967ce7d3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "今年澳网半决赛，阿尔卡拉斯对兹维列夫。第三盘，阿尔卡拉斯的腿出了问题，拿到一次医疗暂停。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "1e44d09186defa36abcb839b511c89e6263fbe7b3c63d17e40b02510d14f38eb",
      "words_sha256": "f858070c9cbe5281a85353dd34f49bd5f99e4eead5a291a5459179e141d61362",
      "words_path": "voice_22.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bb85af4af9c2ca83f3e978285caaed5f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "医疗暂停之后，他接着打。兹维列夫很不满，认为抽筋不该给医疗暂停。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "42b61793a14d24e25539d6d36c60bfc3322be0966b537c6e38234ea6fae6f4d1",
      "words_sha256": "238daf30f736f2b2f7183b95e7c222ae91b5263b44797b31fe0701b11052f2c6",
      "words_path": "voice_23.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "131d26f7e9c95629d8c0d12703419c7e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "阿尔卡拉斯说，他以为是受伤。最后他五盘获胜，打了五小时二十七分钟。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "e708a8031a2183233567569b287c77a773481696260dcf36f449b9be5a3771a2",
      "words_sha256": "13c2e44e838ce0b29db2e77d2446ee93197173ca7f29a932baabc47154de13b8",
      "words_path": "voice_24.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d4e220b01d83a7e86e73c7967c6b2acc",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "规则写得很清楚。可抽筋到倒地，该不该多给几秒？评论区说说。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_cover.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "364f559292b7cd49ec16cf5f6f757d5143c37b2fb72cf191ef9ae92879e1c43e",
      "words_sha256": "e2c44b7b613763f669e5c8ae50ffd5e778362752412caf8fa8502a969ae5e5f9",
      "words_path": "voice_cover.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5ab45aa7f5e62b4e836b1377324e97ee",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "抽筋倒地，为什么还被警告？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_outro.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "2e5e3339586b835923d7096948e8d74fa24a436fd5e6f277ec79ed45f1b4ef82",
      "words_sha256": "74d567be7f7803b20932324ddb499c26d9b44b49f356f71996592439089032e6",
      "words_path": "voice_outro.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "af22f51fce8f3da423780517f6e00b95",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    }
  ]
}
